WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.500
Do you have an idea you want to explore?

2
00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:10.900
Finding out who else is doing it takes a week you do not have.

3
00:00:10.900 --> 00:00:15.400
It should be as easy as saying the idea out loud.

4
00:00:15.400 --> 00:00:21.700
So type it. Here: an app helping small farms sell straight to restaurants.

5
00:00:21.700 --> 00:00:26.000
That is the whole input. No account, no setup.

6
00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:30.700
It goes and reads the public web. About two minutes.

7
00:00:30.700 --> 00:00:38.700
Three companies already doing this.

8
00:00:38.700 --> 00:00:45.000
You had not heard of any of them. That is the part you cannot do yourself.

9
00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:53.000
It shows what it decided your idea was.

10
00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:59.000
Wrong reading, wrong report. So you get to see it, and change it.

11
00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:06.700
Everything below is what it found, and where each piece came from.

12
00:01:06.700 --> 00:01:10.700
What they charge is next.
